# 1) The “order guide” that shows how ops appear (by lot) in sorted_df:
ops_order_table = make_ops_presence_order(sorted_df)
display(ops_order_table)  # shows rows like: lot | 1020-5001, lot | 5001-5001, ...

# 2) The final KPI table (columns in the order discovered above)
kpi = make_lot_summary_table(sorted_df, unit="hours")
display(kpi)

